<Layout title="BOWSWC QuickBooks Integration - Hocking Luxury Lodges" description="Information about the BOWSWC internal QuickBooks Online integration." noindex={true}>
  <div class="container py-4">
    <h1>BOWSWC QuickBooks Integration</h1>

    <p>BOWSWC is a private, internal accounting tool operated by Because Our Wives Said
    We Could LLC. It connects to our own QuickBooks Online company through Intuit's
    official API to help maintain our bookkeeping records.</p>

    <h2>There is no web application to sign in to</h2>

    <p>This integration is a command line utility that runs on infrastructure we
    control. It has no hosted dashboard, no customer login, and no public user
    interface. If you followed a link here expecting an application to launch, that
    is why there is nothing to sign in to.</p>

    <p>The tool is not offered to the public. It is not sold, licensed, or distributed,
    and it has no users outside our own company.</p>

    <h2>Connecting or reconnecting</h2>

    <p>Authorization is performed directly by an administrator of our QuickBooks
    company, using Intuit's standard OAuth 2.0 flow, initiated from the machine
    where the tool runs. There is no web-based connect button, because there is no
    web application.</p>

    <p>If the connection lapses, an administrator repeats that authorization from the
    same machine.</p>

    <h2>Disconnecting</h2>

    <p>Access can be revoked at any time, and revocation takes effect immediately.
    Either method works:</p>

    <ul>
      <li>In <strong>QuickBooks Online</strong>, open the connected apps settings and disconnect
        BOWSWC.</li>
      <li>In the <strong>Intuit developer console</strong>, revoke the app's authorization.</li>
    </ul>

    <p>No action on this website is required to disconnect, and nothing on this page
    can grant or remove access.</p>

    <h2>Data handling</h2>

    <p>The tool reads and records accounting data within our own QuickBooks company
    only. It does not access any other Intuit account. Data is not sold, rented,
    shared, or transferred to third parties.</p>

    <p>Full details:</p>

    <ul>
      <li><a href="/legal/quickbooks-integration-eula/">End User License Agreement</a></li>
      <li><a href="/legal/quickbooks-integration-privacy/">Privacy Policy</a></li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Relationship to Intuit</h2>

    <p>BOWSWC is not produced, endorsed, or supported by Intuit Inc. QuickBooks and
    QuickBooks Online are trademarks of Intuit Inc.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>

    <p><strong>luxehauslodge@gmail.com</strong></p>
  </div>
</Layout>
